# RIDO Phase 2 Architecture & Implementation Plan (Restructured)
## Auth, RBAC, Proximity Dispatch, Door-to-Door Surcharges & QR Code Receiver Verification

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This updated plan incorporates **Door-to-Door Delivery** (with dynamic pricing surcharges) vs **Hub/Motor Park Pickup** (e.g., NURTW hubs), **Unique Receiver Pickup IDs**, and **QR Code Scanning Verification** for both Door-to-Door carriers and Receiving Hub officials.

---

## 1. Business Model & Participant Architecture

RIDO connects **Senders**, **Carriers/Travelers** (independent individuals & registered logistics fleet drivers), and **Receivers** (individual doorstep customers or registered motor park hubs like **NURTW**).

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Sender] -->|1. Chooses Delivery Mode| B{Delivery Mode}
    B -->|Door-to-Door + Extra Surcharge| C[Door-to-Door Carrier Dispatch]
    B -->|Hub/Park Pickup Standard Rate| D[Hub Transfer Carrier Dispatch]

    C -->|2. Proximity Matching| E[Nearest Carrier Accepted]
    D -->|2. Proximity Matching| E

    E -->|3. Pickup & Live GPS Map Tracking| F{Arrival Verification}

    F -->|Door-to-Door Delivery| G[Carrier Scans Customer Receiver QR Code]
    F -->|Hub / Park Delivery| H[Hub Log Package Arrival]
    H -->|Customer Visits Hub| I[Hub Official Scans Receiver QR Code / Unique ID]

    G -->|4. Validated| J[Instant Escrow Funds Release & Payout]
    I -->|4. Validated| J
```

### Participant Categories & Delivery Modes

#### A. Delivery Modes & Pricing Mechanics
1. **Door-to-Door Delivery**:
   - Package is picked up from Sender and delivered directly to the Customer Receiver's doorstep.
   - **Pricing Surcharge**: Attracts an additional Door-to-Door service fee multiplier (configurable in `PricingConfig`).
2. **Hub/Motor Park Pickup (e.g. NURTW Hubs)**:
   - Package is delivered to a registered Receiving Hub or Motor Park.
   - Customer Receiver receives a **Unique Pickup ID** & **Encrypted QR Code** via SMS/App Notification to visit the hub and retrieve the parcel.

#### B. Roles & Hierarchy
- `SENDER`: Launches request, selects `DOOR_TO_DOOR` or `HUB_PICKUP`, pays escrow.
- `TRAVELER` (Individual / Fleet Driver): Receives proximity dispatch, broadcasts live GPS pings, scans Receiver QR code for Door-to-Door deliveries.
- `RECEIVER` (Customer): Receives live tracking link, Unique Pickup ID, and QR Code for parcel verification.
- `RECEIVER_HUB` (e.g. NURTW Park Official / Warehouse): Scans Customer QR Code upon hub visit, releases package, and completes escrow.
- `FLEET_ADMIN`: Fleet monitoring & analytics.
- `ADMIN`: Global operator dashboard & dispute resolution.

