## 2. Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) & Delivery Mode Matrix

| Role | Scope | Key Permissions & Capabilities |
|---|---|---|
| `SENDER` | Self | Select delivery mode (`DOOR_TO_DOOR` or `HUB_PICKUP`), view live GPS map tracking, generate receiver QR payload. |
| `TRAVELER` | Self / Fleet | Broadcast location pings, accept/decline proximity dispatches, **scan Receiver QR Code for Door-to-Door delivery validation**. |
| `RECEIVER` (Customer) | Self | View live map tracking stream, access **Unique Pickup ID** & **Encrypted QR Code**, receive SMS/Push notifications. |
| `RECEIVER_HUB` (NURTW) | Hub Location Scoped | Receive incoming hub arrivals, **scan Customer Receiver QR Code** at hub counter, confirm parcel handover, trigger escrow release. |
| `FLEET_ADMIN` | Fleet Scoped | Live map tracking of all fleet drivers, monitor end-to-end active deliveries, view fleet earnings. |
| `CYBERNET_ADMIN` / `ADMIN` | Global System | Manage Door-to-Door pricing surcharges, approve/suspend hubs and fleet companies, resolve escrow disputes. |

